        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right: use a getter."
      },
      {
        "text": "`Int` is final",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Extensions work on final types."
      },
      {
        "text": "The name `bonus` is reserved",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It is not."
      }
